#
# LOCAL this pass — raw copies and evidence, no page points at them:
#   macros/*_macros-cache.txt   raw cache text (the .html render is the page)
#   macros/*_macros-cache.html  duplicate of the _gewey_gui render
#   Research/_raw/retail_relics.json    parsed retail archaeology
#   Research/_local/_retail_relics.py   the extractor
