# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-11-16 late (Tandumonium, "Wipefest second door" pass).
#
# PUBLIC this pass - the new pane and every edge that reaches it:
#   _gewey_gui/log_ledger.html      new wing; self-contained, no runtime fetch
#   _gewey_gui/index.html           sidebar button "iLogLedger"
#   _gewey_gui/<16 pages>.html      one nav chip each (idempotent wiring)
#   _gewey_gui/_fuhevva_evva.html   home card
# Nothing on the page fetches the JSON at runtime: every number is embedded
# at build time, so no data file has to ship beside it.
#
# LOCAL this pass - the sweep, its checkpoint, its renderer, its wiring:
#   Research/_local/_wipefest_sweep.py   470 report codes -> api.wipefest.gg
#   Research/_local/_log_ledger_build.py JSON -> _gewey_gui/log_ledger.html
