#   Research/_raw/wipefest_sweep.json          470 reports, 4k pulls (local)
#   Research/_raw/wipefest_sweep.json.partial  resume checkpoint (local)
#   Research/_raw/wipefest_sweep.log(+.err)    run transcript (local)
# Research/_local/ and Research/_raw/ already cover every path above; this
# block exists to STATE the rule, not to widen it. The one explicit pattern
# below is for the checkpoint, which lives beside the payload.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Research/_raw/wipefest_sweep.json.partial
Research/_raw/wipefest_sweep.log
Research/_raw/wipefest_sweep.log.err


