#   _gewey_gui/_css/holy_word.css label rule for iKindred
#   _gewey_gui/_fuhevva_evva.html directory card
#   _gewey_gui/macrocosm.html     Kindred chip + a plain-anchor list for the
#                                 four macro caches (they were iframe-only, so
#                                 nothing could crawl or deep-link them)
#   _gewey_gui/Company.html       WOWHEAD block added (it was the one wing with
#                                 no whTooltips / power.js)
#   _gewey_gui/Passersby.html     WOWHEAD block added (same gap, other wing)
#   _gewey_gui/wide_legacy.html   WOWHEAD block added (same gap, shell stub)
#   _gewey_gui/<40 pages>.html    one Kindred nav chip each (wing_links.py)
#   Timeline/wing_links.py        Wing 37 registered so --check keeps it
# Every figure on Kindred.html (13 doors, 9 live, 4 gone, 41 btwl saves) is
# baked in at build time, so no data file has to ship beside the page.
#
# LOCAL this pass - builders, wires and the payload they read:
#   Research/_local/_kindred_build.py      the table -> the page + the payload
#   Research/_local/_wire_kindred_nav.py   button, css rule, card, chips
#   Research/_local/_tooltip_gap_fix.py    the tooltip backfill above
#   Research/_raw/kindred_armory_20261125.json   the sweep, for re-derivation
# Research/_local/ and Research/_raw/ already cover those; the patterns below
# are belt and braces for anyone who moves one out of those folders.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Research/_raw/kindred_*.*
**/_kindred_build.py
**/_wire_kindred_nav.py
**/_tooltip_gap_fix.py
**/_kindred_*.out
**/_kindred_*.err

